Package: trax
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: file-finding utility for V\OS
 TraX is a traditional find tool that searches the disk every time, in two
 flavours: TraX (find-style with a Mac-like interface) and FastTraX (a
 Windows-find lookalike).
